UID:261116l8ZV7IUqy0CybH8XuUS6IA
DESCRIPTION:After the Thanksgiving celebrations\, return to center with a 
 restorative morning of movement and mindfulness. This all-levels Vinyasa f
 low pairs energizing\, heat-building postures with heart-opening movement 
 and grounding hip stretches\, all guided by intentional breath. Release te
 nsion\, reconnect with your body and create space to savor the day ahead. 
 You’ll leave the Estate Cave feeling refreshed\, rooted and ready to emb
 race the holidays with a renewed sense of gratitude.
LOCATION:Estate Cave
URL:https://www.meritageresort.com/experience/event-calendar/gratitude-and
 -grounding/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
