DESCRIPTION:Organized by: Griffo Distillery — https://www.eventbrite.com
 /o/12736133200 Get ready to rock out at this special Sunday Sessions! Wann
 a see your future? Come rock out for a special Sunday Sessions with Crysta
 l Ballers at Griffo! Get ready to hear these SoCo rock and rollers for a S
 unday afternoon full of your favorite hits\, delicious food from our pals 
 at Tommy's Salsa\, and of course the fantastic fall cocktail lineup from t
 he Griffo Team! See you Sundays! Who's Playing: Crystal Ballers Who's Cook
 ing: Tommy's Salsa When: Sunday\, November 29th - Doors @ 1pm Where: Griff
 o Distillery Please RSVP for this FREE\, All Ages Event. Space is Limited.
  About the Band: Crystal Ballers brings the alternative rock of the ’90s
  and 2000s back to the stage — loud\, live\, and built for a crowd. From
  Rage Against the Machine\, Radiohead and Stone Temple Pilots to Weezer\, 
 Third Eye Blind\, Incubus\, Cake\, Green Day and more\, we play the songs 
 that defined an era. Made up of longtime Bay Area musicians with roots goi
 ng back to the ’90s\, Crystal Ballers brings years of live experience to
  clubs\, festivals and private events throughout Northern California.
LOCATION:Griffo Distillery
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1683361766643291/?acontext=%7B%22event
 _action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%
