 y. Napa Yard\, voted among the nation's top beer gardens\, welcomes award-
 winning singer-songwriter Joyce Lee for live music from 4 to 7 PM. Grab a 
 local craft beer and a bite\, settle into the yard\, and enjoy a genre-flu
 id set of rock\, folk\, soul and pop favorites played with her own spin\, 
 plus a few originals along the way.
