DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T120000
UID:261110j7eadsiUaEeSnzBO1dRfRA
DESCRIPTION:Wild mushroom season has arrived on the Sonoma Coast\, where m
 isty forests and coastal meadows nurture a dazzling diversity of fungi for
  curious foragers and culinary enthusiasts alike.\n\nJoin Ty the Fungi\, a
  seasoned local forager with nearly 15 years of experience\, and learn how
  to find\, identify\, and responsibly harvest wild mushrooms—from prized
  edibles to those best left untouched. Discover the principles of ethical 
 foraging and deepen your connection to the landscape through this immersiv
 e\, hands-on exploration.\n\nMeet at The Lodge’s Fireside Lounge\, and w
 e’ll caravan together to the foraging site.\n\n$160 per person\, $100 (a
