UID:260929PbQ5W2JiT0yJ91Fgo7otIw
DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY SESSIONS IN THE LOUNGE ROTATING DJs • OPEN FORMAT •
  REQUESTS WELCOME • NO COVER\n\nSunday nights have a new home in The Lou
 nge at Barrel Proof.\n\nEvery Sunday at 8 PM\, a rotating lineup of DJs ta
 kes over the front room for Sunday Sessions — an open-format dance party
  where the playlist isn't locked into one genre and requests are part of t
 he fun.\n\nOpen format means the DJ gets to read the room. One song might 
 take you back\, the next might be something you were blasting in the car t
 his week. Different genres\, different eras and different DJs from week to
  week\, with plenty of room for the crowd to help steer the night.\n\nGot 
 a song you want to hear? Ask the DJ.\n\nAnd there's more happening under t
 he same roof. Start your evening with Sunday Funday Comedy at 6 PM\, then 
 at 8 PM Barrel Proof gives you two ways to keep the night going:\n\n THE 
 LOUNGE — 8 PM Sunday Sessions Rotating DJs • Open Format • Requests 
 • Dancing\n\n MAIN ROOM — 8 PM Sunday Night Karaoke Grab the mic and 
 sing on the big stage.\n\nDance in the Lounge\, sing in the Main Room\, or
  bounce between the two all night.\n\nEvery Sunday • 8 PM Barrel Proof L
 ounge 501 Mendocino Ave • Downtown Santa Rosa 21+ • No Cover\n\nCheck 
 out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/sunday-sessions-in-the-lounge-djs-dancing
 -requests-tickets-2002178174818?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T170000
UID:260824voSA8Kz5REe_uOXuRruZig
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pianist Larry Vuchovich Birthday Celebration At Sebastiani Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T170000
UID:260728Z8cjkbFGgkybHcTYf8OGrg
DESCRIPTION:Pianist Larry Vuchovich with Special Guest Star Vocalist Jacki
 e Ryan\n\nLarry Vuckovich is a Yugoslavian-born American jazz pianist accl
 aimed for his eclectic style blending bop\, post-bop\, blues\, and world m
 usic. Classically trained in Kotor\, he emigrated to San Francisco in 1951
 \, studied with Vince Guaraldi\, and performed with legends like Mel Torm
 é\, Jon Hendricks\, Philly Joe Jones\, and Dexter Gordon. A fixture at to
 p US and European jazz venues\, he leads ensembles such as Blue Balkan and
  has been honored with multiple lifetime achievement awards.
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:http://www.sonomavalleyjazzsociety.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T103000
UID:260728URVDMC-_xUC39EeP6bmxEA
DESCRIPTION:Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.\n\nIn OA\, membe
 rs experience spiritual\, emotional\, and physical recovery by practicing 
 the Twelve Steps and living by their spiritual principles—one day at a t
 ime.\n\nOvereaters Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support ea
 ch other in recovering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you f
 eel you have a problem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your b
 ackground\, beliefs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person meetings
  at 9:30 on Sunday mornings at Church of the Nazarene\, 18980 Arnold Drive
 \, Sonoma\, CA (a small room directly off of parking lot\; look for the si
 gn posted) and newcomers are always welcome.\n\nYou may view all North Bay
  OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.h
 tml\n\nOA is not a diet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have 
 different plans of eating.\n\nOA does not endorse any specific food plan.
  \n\nVisit: https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\nFind a meeting: https://www.no
 rthbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Church of the Nazarene  (a small room directly off of parking lot
 \; look for the sign posted)
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
