BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BellyDancing with Carem
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T190000
UID:2610126kbhTL3xAE2s-OAK2py66Q
DESCRIPTION:Bellydancing for Beginners \n\nDiscover the beauty of Raqs Sh
 arqi \\(bellydance\\). This beginner-friendly class introduces you to fou
 ndational bellydance technique\, including hip movements\, isolations\, un
 dulations\, traveling steps\, combinations and musicality. You’ll develo
 p coordination\, body awareness\, strength\, and confidence while learning
  to move with greater ease and expression.\n\nNo previous dance experience
  is required. All bodies and experience levels are welcome.\n\nCome move t
 o the music\, connect with your body\, and discover the joy of bellydancin
 g\n\nCAREM LOVE\n\nCarem Love is a wellness advocate\, professional dancer
 \, and certified yoga instructor with a Bachelor’s degree in Dance. She 
 has extensive training in Bellydance\, a deep passion for Latin dance\, an
 d is certified in Hatha\, Vinyasa\, and Children’s Yoga.\n\nBelly dance 
 has profoundly supported her health\, well-being\, and dance career\, insp
 iring her to help others experience the same body-mind benefits. In her cl
 asses\, students learn to connect more deeply with themselves.\n\nDATE: Mo
 nday\n\nTIME: 6:00 PM\n\nWHERE: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, S
 an Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-with-carem/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AHA BLS Certification Class (Blended Learning)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T123000
UID:260920pmPI0fyXekC50wtK1bYP1A
DESCRIPTION:AHA BLS Certification Class \\(Blended Learning\\)\n\nBLS Blen
 ded Learning / BLS Skills Session\n\nAHA BLS certification course for heal
 thcare providers. Blended Learning consists of an online course followed b
 y an in-person Skills Session. This American Heart Association Basic Life 
 Support class includes skills testing of cardiac and respiratory arrest ma
 nagement\, CPR\, AED use\, and choking treatment for all ages.\n\nAmerican
  Heart Association BLS Provider certifications are issued on the same day.
 \n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company with over 1\,000 5
 -star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and expertly taught by exp
 erienced first responders.\n\nLEARN MORE and ENROLL: https://vivecpr.com/c
 lass/heartcode-bls/\n\nCONTACT US: \\(707\\) 612-3277
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/heartcode-bls/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Antarctica: The Frozen Desert | Photographs by Vegar Abelsnes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T170000
UID:260914vMkQ0WivYkSz-tdg2wxShg
DESCRIPTION:1st Street Gallery at WTRSHD will present *“Antarctica: The 
 Frozen Desert\,”* a new body of fine art photography by Vegar Abelsnes\,
  opening September 26th\, 2026\, and on view September through November. 
  The exhibition marks a deliberate turn in Abelsnes’ photography\; after
  more than two decades of working in a commercial and advertising capacity
 \, he has embarked on a career as a photo and field guide in the polar reg
 ions. The exhibit features work generated over 6 *voyages to the* Antarcti
 c Peninsula. He is returning to Antarctica in January and will add the Fal
 klands and South Georgia to his list of destinations to guide and photogra
 ph.\n\nTraveling to some of the most remote and inhospitable coastlines on
  Earth\, Abelsnes has photographed a landscape that exists almost entirely
  outside of human time. The ice in these images began forming millions of 
 years ago\, while Homo sapiens have only existed for roughly 300\,000 year
 s. Defined by such a scale\, Antarctica is less a place than a record — 
 vast\, indifferent\, treacherous\, and staggeringly beautiful\, holding a 
 kind of cosmic truth that Abelsnes says is more important now than ever be
 fore.
LOCATION:1st Street Gallery @ WTRSHD
URL:https://vegarabelsnes.com/ANTARCTICA:-The-Frozen-Desert/thumbs
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261130T170000
UID:260824K0i7PRenLEmHICvbANGx2Q
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
