DESCRIPTION:The 12 Jays of Xmas VIP Donor Celebration is a special holiday
  gathering honoring the supporters and community behind Emerald Triangle C
 raft's 12 Jays of Xmas project. Celebrate 12 independent legacy cannabis f
 arms from California's Emerald Triangle\, connect with fellow supporters\,
  and help support the Humboldt County Growers Alliance (HCGA).\n\nVIP dono
 r registration is available through the Emerald Triangle Craft website\, w
 ith contribution levels of **$125\, $250\, and $550**. Join us for a celeb
