DESCRIPTION:Please come by and check out our offerings of quality used out
 door clothing and gear. We’ll be playing music and having a good time.\n
 \nHappy Trails Bazaar\, is an inspirational used outdoor gear and clothing
  store founded by husband-and-wife team Benjamin Renaud and Lynn McFarlane
 \, and we're finally ready to open the doors!\n\nThe store offers quality 
 pre-owned outdoor clothing and equipment\, including backpacks\, tents\, c
 amping gear\, sleeping bags and pads\, footwear\, technical clothing\, ski
 s\, snowboards\, paddling gear\, cycling accessories and plenty more.\n\nW
 e've been working hard on creating a fun and inspiring environment here\, 
 and hope you will stop by and see what we have been up to.\n\nOur regular 
 hours will be 10am - 6pm - Closed on Monday & Tuesday\n\n***Happy Trails!*
