DESCRIPTION:Experience the brilliance of Mozart’s greatest operatic mome
 nts in “Mozart on Stage\,” a dazzling showcase of scenes from Le Nozze
  di Figaro\, Don Giovanni\, and other beloved works. Featuring the univers
 ity’s finest vocal talent\, this concert offers a fresh\, contemporary v
 isual twist on Mozart’s timeless portrait\, inviting audiences to hear t
 he genius anew. Don’t miss this unforgettable fusion of classic melody a
 nd modern artistry.
