 ” concert at 4 pm on Sunday\, December 6\, in downtown Petaluma. \n\nTh
 e concert features Leo Delibes’ lovely Messe Breve and the spirited “B
 oa Noite\, Minha Gente\,” a festive Brazilian song for women inspired by
  the “baiana” celebration.\n\nThis is the Chorus’ first season singi
 ng in our new home\, the historic Hall of the Above at 199 N. Petaluma Blv
