UID:261122tzA2IMYXhkauPDEXyRDMJA
DESCRIPTION:Friday–Sunday ◆ December 4–6\, 2026\n\nFree admission\n\
 nOnce a year the center is transformed into a magical winter wonderland\, 
 filled to the brim with handmade goods – many of which have been made in
 side the very walls of the Center.\n\nPeruse over 70 juried artist vendors
  ranging in medium including but not limited to ceramics\, fiber arts\, pa
 inting\, photography\, jewelry\, metalwork\, woodwork\, and more.\n\nOpeni
 ng night\n\nFriday:\n\nDecember 4\n\n4:00 – 7:00 PM\n\nFirst pick of the
  whole market\, before anything sells out.\n\nBusiest day\n\nSaturday:\n\n
 December 5\n\n10:00 AM – 5:00 PM\n\nSeven full hours\, every room open\,
  the most artists on site\n\nEasiest browse:\n\nSunday\n\nDecember 6\n\n10
