  timeless story of Clara and her journey through the Land of Sweets.\n\nTh
 is year’s event takes place on December 5th and 6th 2026\, at 1:00 PM an
 d 5PM. The performance will be held at Novato High School – Center for 
 the Arts\, located at 625 Arthur Street\, Novato\, CA 94947.\n\nDon’t mi
 ss your chance to experience the 2026 Marin Ballet Nutcracker in person! W
 e can’t wait to share this special event with you.\n\nTickets: Child Tic
 ket up to age 18 or Seniors 65\\+: $34.59 Adult Tickets Age 19\\+: $60.84
