DESCRIPTION:Jack London Park Partners and California State Parks will hold
  their 2026 Annual Meeting on Tuesday\, Dec. 8\, beginning at 5:30 p.m.\, 
 at the House of Happy Walls Museum inside the park.\n\nThe public is invit
 ed to attend to learn more about the goals of this thriving public/nonprof
 it partnership and how it serves the communities and park visitors.  Ques
 tions\, suggestions and comments are welcome. \n\nDue to limited space\, 
