DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T220000
UID:260717u2FpioXyp0KAW7Yd_hhrkQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Tony Sparks "The Godfather of Comedy" every Tuesday with 
 new comedians each week!\n\nThe Godfather of Bay Area Comedy is BACK and h
 e's hosting comics from the Bay Area\, Sacramento\, South Bay\, North Bay 
 and beyond - different comedians every week! The best free comedy show in 
 Sonoma County just got even better! Come join us!\n\n21+ Doors @7pm / Show
