 ber 12th 2-5pm**\n\nMembers receive 2 complimentary tickets\n\nGuests • 
 $50\n\nNo skis required\, just good wine and great company!\n\nJoin us for
  a winter afternoon at CAST as we bring a little après-ski charm to wine 
 country.\n\nThink cozy fireside sipping\, delicious winter bites\, live mu
 sic\, and festive fun\, all set against the beautiful backdrop of Dry Cre
 ek Valley.\n\nBundle up\, grab a glass\, and settle in for an afternoon of
  wine\, friends\, and winter vibes. Whether you’re here to mingle\, sip\
 , or simply enjoy the season\, there’s no better place to après than CA
 ST! \n\nClub members: be sure to log-in to get your tickets discounted. Y
