 storytellers and then an Open Mic part of the show\, featuring two options
 : you can either throw your name in the hat to tell a 5-minute story or a 
 1-minute story in our Story Sprint lighting round. No theme\, just bring y
 our best story. Sign up at the door. Come out for a night of live\, friend
 ly and fun storytelling in a cozy\, comfortable venue that is just right f
 or an evening of great tales. Newcomers to storytelling very welcome. We
 ’d love to see you there. PLUS we will celebrate the Season with some fe
 stive food - a few appetizers from England and America.
LOCATION:Courtyard by Marriott
URL:http://www.sixfeetapartproductions.com/shuffle.php
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
