DESCRIPTION:**Come join us for a very fun day of shopping and yummy baked 
 goods! Saturday\, November 7th and December 12th from 9am to 4pm in downto
 wn Sebastopol inside at the Masonic Center across from Safeway. We have am
 azing quality and exciting vendors with shopper friendly prices\, featurin
 g Vintage\, Thrift & Handmade Goods along with many Collectibles and Gift 
 items. Bake Sale proceeds go to fund local Sebastopol Schools\, and School
  Projects/Clubs. Vintage of all kinds\, Clothing\, Jewelry\, Mid Century M
 odern\, Small Furniture\, Glass\, Art\, Jewelry\, Vinyl Records\, Architec
 tural Salvage\, Fabrics\, old books\, magazines & ephemera\, kitchen ware
 s & collectibles\, garden\, tools. So many Beautiful Handmade Goods\, soa
 ps & botanical & body products\, amazing arts & crafts\, wood products &
  gifts\, Swedish Ceramics\, Swedish & Japanese Textile Arts\, crystal wa
 nds\, children's clothing and boutique dresses\, Custom Rainbow Clothing 
 Press\, beautiful crochet items & animals and so much more. Free Admissio
 n and plenty of free parking in the area.**
LOCATION:Sebastopol Masonic Center
URL:https://www.facebook.com/marketplace/item/1121060717494907
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Osborn Mushroom Blitz 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261212T130000
UID:261105j5_0FpaBrEerq5d_S3zBVw
DESCRIPTION:Wild fungi are amazing! They give us a window into the health 
 of our ecosystems\, play a vital role in plant growth and communication\, 
 and can remove heavy metals from soil and water. For the ninth consecutive
  year\, students and the community will traverse the forests and fields of
  Osborn Preserve to collect and record as many fungal species as possible.
  Join us and build identification and sustainable harvesting skills while 
 adding to our research database.
LOCATION:Fairfield Osborn Preserve
URL:https://cei.sonoma.edu/osborn-mushroom-2026
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
