DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
UID:261127wEQLOdqYv0uhwtHGCF8_jA
DESCRIPTION:Members of the Jack London Piano Club will fill the House of H
 appy Walls Museum with a special program of winter and holiday pieces. It 
 is the perfect way to pause the seasonal rush and treat yourself to a peac
 eful Sunday escape.\n\nEnjoy the beautiful music on Charmian London’s ch
 erished 1901 Steinway baby grand piano. Charmian’s musical talent filled
  their home with warmth\, and her piano was often at the center of the Lon
 dons’ lively gatherings.\n\nSince 2011\, the Piano Club has offered quar
 terly concerts on this historic instrument and has raised more than 25\,00
 0 dollars in support of park operations.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park 
URL:https://jacklondonpark.com/events/notes-of-the-season-winter-2026/
