BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:When I Rise Up - Choral Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
UID:261116gA914OjCxUmozXNSGhAq-w
DESCRIPTION:The Occidental Community Choir puts on live concerts featuring
  an eclectic mix of locally composed music\, classical and contemporary ch
 oral pieces\, poetry\, and spoken word from our community in the redwoods 
 of Northern California.\n\nThis season\, "When I Rise Up\," will remind us
  that hope is not passive\, justice is not someone else's work\, and the f
 uture is something that we create together. We'll explore songs of joy\, h
 ope\, resilience\, justice\, and protest. Some of our programming will cha
 llenge us to confront difficult truths and some of it will remind us that 
 even in times of division\, compassion\, courage\, and community can light
  the way forward.\n\nWe don't answer those questions all at once. We endea
 vor to answer it by the choices we make\, by the people we stand beside\, 
 and by the hope we refuse to surrender.\n\nJoin the Occidental Community C
 hoir this winter for an evening of music that aims to bring a little more 
 light into this world.
LOCATION:Glaser Center
URL:https://www.occidentalchoir.org/concerts
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
