BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intimacy with Life: Undoing the Habits That Armor the Heart with T
 ara Brach
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T160000
UID:261012i02m59W_AEegAI0OCsUPDw
DESCRIPTION:with James Baraz\, MA\, Tara Brach\, PhD and Jill White Lindsa
 y\n\nJoin us for a day of meditation and inquiry devoted to loosening the 
 habits that separate us from our inner life and from each other. As our he
 arts open\, we may rediscover our capacity for joy\, deepen our sense of k
 inship with all beings\, and engage more actively in caring for our world.
 \n\nJill White Lindsay will be guiding us in simple stretches and movement
  to ground us in our bodies as we go through the day.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/intimacy-with-life-und
 oing-the-habits-that-armor-the-heart-jb2d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Symphony - Winterlude… Handel’s Messiah
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T170000
UID:2609291YF9eGwSskG-vwlUN6b02g
DESCRIPTION:Winterlude… Handel’s *Messiah*\n\nDecember 12\, 2026\, at 
 7:30 pm & December 13\, 2026\, at 3:00 pm\n\nWeill Hall\, Green Music Cent
 er\n\n**Francesco Lecce-Chong\,** conductor and harpsichord\n\n**Santa Ros
 a Symphony Chorus\,** **Jenny Bent\,** director\n\n**GEORGE FRIDERIC HANDE
 L:** *Messiah* \\[oratorio\\] for Solo Voices\, Orchestra and Chorus HWV 5
 6\n\nIntroducing Winterlude...\, a new annual winter tradition. For its in
 augural year\, we present Handel’s *Messiah*—a cherished musical rite 
 of the season. Uplifting and joyful\, this choral masterpiece concludes wi
 th the 'Hallelujah' chorus\, offering inspiring meditation on hope and the
  promise of a better world.\n\n**Programs\, artists\, dates\, and prices a
 re subject to change without notice. Tickets are subject to availability. 
 All Tickets are nonrefundable.**
LOCATION:Green Music Center
URL:https://srsymphony.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SPe000003
