DESCRIPTION:Winter Wonder Lantern Walks at Sonoma Botanical Garden offers 
 a peaceful\, after-dark experience celebrating the beauty of the holiday s
 eason. Guided by Garden staff and volunteers\, guests stroll through the w
 inter landscape carrying glowing lanterns\, exploring softly lit pathways 
 and towering trees beneath the night sky. The evening begins with hot coco
 a\, spiced cider\, wine tasting\, and cookies\, followed by a welcome and 
 lantern walk orientation before the guided stroll. This immersive experien
 ce provides a unique opportunity to enjoy the Garden after hours while emb
 racing the season's tranquility. Winter Wonder Lantern Walks also serves a
 s a seasonal fundraiser supporting the Garden's programs\, collections\, a
 nd conservation efforts.
