SUMMARY:Nicolas Bearde celebrates Charles Brown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T193000
UID:261020XZutCpggM0ehxi7Qo7AFfw
DESCRIPTION:The Jazz Examiner says: "Bearde's sophisticated\, revelatory v
 ocals are simply stunning in their bare essence?\n\nSan Francisco-based Ni
 colas Bearde is a bona fide jazz master who first made his mark more than 
 30 years ago as a founding member of Bobby McFerrin's wildly innovative a 
 capella ensemble\, " Voicestra".  He has released 6 solo CD's on the Right
  Groove Records label\, and has won accolades from critics and jazz audien
 ces worldwide for his "velvet tone" and engaging performances.\n\nBearde's
  music has been critically acclaimed by Jazziz\, Jazz Times\, Jazz Week an
 d All About Jazz\, and as leader has performed and/or recorded around the 
 world from San Francisco and New York to London\, Paris\, Moscow and Bejin
 g with such luminaries such as Vincent Herring\, Eric Alexander\, Josh Nel
 son and Nat Adderley\, Jr.
LOCATION:Brannan Center
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108873160?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Nights with DJ BRXNDO – Live in The Lounge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T235900
UID:260929wtLWORk7w0a4463zQsXKvQ
DESCRIPTION:THURSDAY NIGHTS WITH DJ BRXNDO OPEN FORMAT • REQUESTS • DA
 NCING • NO COVER\n\nThursday nights have a new home in The Lounge at Bar
 rel Proof. Every Thursday at 9 PM\, DJ BRXNDO takes over the front room wi
 th an open-format set built around the crowd\, the dance floor and your re
 quests.\n\nBRXNDO has been making his way through the Bay Area nightlife s
 cene\, spinning parties from Santa Rosa to San Francisco. Now he's settlin
 g into a weekly Thursday night residency at Barrel Proof.\n\nOpen format m
 eans just that: no single genre gets to run the night. BRXNDO can move thr
 ough Reggaeton\, Hip-Hop\, Latin hits\, Top 40\, throwbacks\, dance tracks
  and party favorites depending on where the room takes him.\n\nHear someth
 ing you want? Make a request.\n\nSome Thursdays might lean Latin. Some mig
 ht turn into a throwback party. Some nights might go somewhere completely 
 different. BRXNDO reads the room and keeps it moving.\n\nWhatever else is 
