DESCRIPTION:Turn up the music\, torch calories\, and start your weekend wi
 th pure energy!\n\nJoin Janeth every Friday from 11:00 AM to 12:15 PM at S
 alsa Dance Marin for an exhilarating 75-minute dance fitness party. Whethe
 r you want to tone up\, boost your stamina\, or simply let loose on the da
 nce floor\, this class blends high-energy.\n\nWhat to Expect in zumba with
  Janeth:\n\n• Full-Body Warm-Up: Awaken your muscles\, activate your cor
 e\, and elevate your heart rate safely.\n\n• The Dance Party Workout: Hi
 gh-energy choreography set to salsa\, cumbia\, merengue\, reggaeton\, and 
 pop beats. Fast and slow rhythms alternate for interval training that maxi
 mizes calorie burn.\n\n• Cool-Down & Lengthening Stretch: Dedicated stre
 tching to restore flexibility\, release muscle tension\, and leave you fee
 ling refreshed and empowered.\n\nClass Details:\n\n• When: Fridays | 11:
 00 AM – 12:15 PM \\(75 Minutes\\)\n\n• Where: Salsa Dance Marin \, 414
 0 Redwood hwy 8\, san Rafael\n\n• Instructor: Janeth\n\n• Level: All f
 itness levels welcome — modifications available for beginners and high-i
 mpact dancers alike. No prior dance experience needed!\n\n• What to Brin
 g: Comfortable workout attire\, supportive athletic shoes\, a water bottle
 \, and a sweat towel.\n\nCome for the workout\, stay for the party — res
 erve your spot on the dance floor this Friday!
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/zumba-with-janeth/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
