DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T210000
UID:261031d190oWMRFkOyJpxfwAqqCQ
DESCRIPTION:Bailey Callahan is the rising voice of Disco Country\n\n- a vi
 brant fusion of 70s-inspired disco flair and authentic country storytellin
 g.\n\nWith more than 150 shows a year under her belt\, Callahan has become
  a touring force\, headlining stages nationwide and establishing herself a
 s the face of Disco Country Night.\n\n​\n\nHer 2025 single "Swayze" quic
 kly became the fastest-growing release of her career\, igniting a new era 
 for Callahan and solidifying her as one of the most exciting new artists i
 n country music. Known for her high-energy performances and magnetic stage
  presence\, she brings audiences into a world where sparkle meets grit\, m
 aking every show a celebration.\n\n​\n\nBailey' s career highlights incl
 ude signing with Limited Edition Music Publishing\,\n\npartnerships with J
 eep and Taylor Guitars\, and recognition from outlets like Rolling Stone\,
  American Songwriter\, and Spotify. With her infectious spirit\, fearless 
 originality\, and genre-bending vision\, Bailey Callahan is redefining wha
 t country music can be - bold\, shimmering\, and undeniably her own.
LOCATION:JaM Cellars
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109062607?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
