BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wreath Making Workshop with Wildflower Wreaths x Petaluma Floral
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T120000
UID:261123BeO9abfnO0alu3mlEbDHZQ
DESCRIPTION:**Boutique Botanical Wreath-Making Workshop | Wildflower Wreat
 hs x Petaluma Floral**\n\nGet creative and think outside the circle! Join 
 Wildflower Wreaths and Petaluma Floral for a hands-on botanical wreath-mak
 ing workshop.\n\nLearn the basics of wreath construction\, explore color a
 nd design\, and discover techniques to take your creation from traditional
  to wild. Experiment with a curated assortment of fresh and dried botanica
 ls to create a one-of-a-kind wreath to take home.\n\nAll experience levels
  are welcome! All materials and tools are provided\, along with a holiday 
 beverage of your choice from Caffeine Inc. Just bring your imagination and
  a willingness to get creative!\n\nA fun way to escape the holiday hustle\
 , enjoy some creative time\, and make something beautiful for yourself or 
 someone special.\n\n**December 19 | 10 AM–12 PM** **Petaluma Floral | Pe
 taluma\, CA** **$175 per person**\n\nLimited to 6 participants. Advance re
 gistration and payment required.
LOCATION:Petaluma Floral
URL:https://www.instagram.com/p/DgD2v8USsZb/?lqvp=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Christmas Nightmare with the Renegade Orchestra
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T200000
UID:2611235wq4Z-R0fkuLf5lUS2ds3w
DESCRIPTION:The Renegade Orchestra presents “A Christmas Nightmare” in
  downtown Napa\n\nWhat happens when musicians get tired of playing the sam
 e old holiday songs - the Renegade Orchestra presents a Christmas Nightmar
 e. No more sappy Rudolph’s - this show is all about the darker side of C
 hristmas. \n\nThe bay area’s favorite rock and roll orchestra plays mus
 ic for a not so silent night featuring frostbite and fiddles\, a creepy li
 ttle Christmas\, and carols in the keys of shadows.\n\nSongs include Wizar
 ds in Winter from the Trans-Siberian Orchestra\, a dark medley of Balkan h
 olidays songs\, and\, of course\, a little Danny Elfman from Nightmare bef
 ore Christmas. \n\nThe concert will be held at the beautiful\, but lesser
  known\, Grand Hall of the Native Sons of the Golden West\, right downtown
  on Coombs St. in Napa.
LOCATION:Native Sons of the Golden West
URL:http://RenegadeOrchestra.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Weekend Santa Sightings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T150000
UID:261122zvDcf_HbQE6TrOL47-Jg9w
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holidays and join us at the Village for photos w
 ith Santa happening on weekends from Saturday\, November 28th to Sunday\, 
 December 20th\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily.\n\nAppointments are highly recomm
 ended\, as we cannot guarantee that we can accommodate all walk-ups throug
 hout the event series. Reserve your 5-minute window now for a $35 fee duri
 ng our initial release (through Friday\, November 13). Beginning Saturday\
 , November 14\, the fee increases to $45. Each family will receive a print
  to take home that day\, as well as a digital copy of their photo followin
 g the appointment. Please note that we do not call or text waitlisted gues
 ts.\\*\n\nMake the most of your Santa visit:\n\nYour photo package include
 s up to five digital photos\, emailed the Monday following your appointmen
 t\, plus a print to take home that day.\n\nEnjoy writing letters to Santa 
 and dropping them off at the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbo
 x\, plus crafts at our holiday craft tables.\n\nSweeten your visit! Stop b
 y Salt & Straw before or after your appointment and enjoy a complimentary 
 kids’ scoop with any ice cream purchase during Weekend Santa Sightings (
 valid each Saturday and Sunday from 11/28/26 to 12/20/26 between 11 a.m. t
 o 3 p.m.).\n\nKeep an eye out for ME SPA’s elves\, spreading holiday che
 er and a little stress relief with special cards to redeem at the spa. Bri
 ng yours in for a Chill Bag\, a holiday survival kit filled with goodies a
 nd coupons to help you keep your cool all season long. For an extra moment
  of relaxation\, enjoy a complimentary chair massage as scheduling allows.
 \n\nRetro Foto will be assisting in making this memory last a lifetime by 
 providing Santa with a vintage ride for all to enjoy! Retro Foto is Sonoma
  County’s boutique photo booth experience. Lola is a fully restored 1970
  Volkswagen bus that loves the camera – whether it’s as a photo booth 
 or a photo backdrop! Lola is all about making memories\, which is why Sant
 a thought this would be the perfect way to drive into the Holiday season!\
 n\nBy attending this event\, guests consent to appear in photo/video recor
 dings that may be used for website photography or other purposes.\n\n\\*A 
 portion of proceeds will benefit Sonoma County Secret Santa Program.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Park Rx-Yoga Hikes 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T123000
UID:261121tTVEP98O9EqX1u4wrxo9RA
DESCRIPTION:Susan Topf’s Yoga Hike balances a mix of easy hiking and gen
 tle yoga postures\, breath work and guided meditation\, no mat necessary. 
 The route varies on weather conditions and group interest\, typically cove
 ring 2-3 miles of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome.\n\nTickets 
 are $20. Please wear weather-appropriate clothing to feel comfortable bein
 g in a natural setting and bring water \\(as needed\\). Meet outside the V
 isitor Center unless otherwise noted in the reminder email prior to the hi
 ke. Limited to 12 participants. \n\nSonoma County Resident? Free with a S
 eptember 2026 or newer Park Rx from a participating Sonoma County Medical 
 Provider. To sign up with a Park Rx\, please forward a PDF of your signed 
 Rx to alma@sonomaecologycenter.org for a sign up code.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://events.sonomaecologycenter.org/2026yoga-hikes
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T203000
UID:261121lmd6c-5WxkSuMwcuAUBp2A
DESCRIPTION:**New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly orig
 inal\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and 
 athletically stunning skill.**\n\n**Sonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 
 –** This 2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La
  Lune Brille’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the i
 ntimate and charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the W
 inter moon and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the s
 ky\, she must find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she 
 encounters mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child
  pleasing origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acro
 bats\, and clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere w
 ith celestial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all
  ages.\n\nSpectators for all showings are invited to the European style ci
 rcus tent to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Corne
 rstone Sonoma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \
 n\nThe event will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half
  hour show.\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Corner
 stone Sonoma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase
  online at thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40.
  Front row (VIP)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details a
 t thenewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly antici
 pated event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent  
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
