 iny\, is simple: to build a mustache army and create a Soft Rock Explosion
  the likes of which has not been seen since Christopher Cross\, Steely Dan
 \, Ace\, Kenny Loggins and The Little River Band ruled the airwaves and cr
 eated AM Gold. So Join us! Party with us\, live with us\, work out at the 
