DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261220T170000
UID:261115s0skJQN0ckuDkW0gAa-qUQ
DESCRIPTION:A NIGHT WITH JANIS JOPLIN\, starring Libby Oberlin is our Chri
 stmas gift to you! The entire cast is back on board bringing this hit back
  to life! This show musically explores Janis Joplin’s music and well as 
 her musical influences. \n\nWritten\, created and originally directed by 
 Randy Johnson\n\nDirected by Loryn Hatten\n\nOriginally directed at SAL by
  Carl Jordan \n\nStarring Libby Oberlin as Janis Joplin\n\nFeaturing Aja 
 Gianola\, Jeffrie Givens\, Michelle Louise\, Simone Mosely\, and Skylaer P
 alacois \n\nMichelle Louise will be playing the role of Janis Joplin on S
 aturday 12/5\, Thursday 12/10 and Thursday 12/19\n\n‘A Night with Janis 
 Joplin’ runs December 4th - 20th\, 2026\n\nThursday - Saturdays 7:30pm\n
 \nSundays 2:00pm\n\nFor Tickets Call 707.204.9990 or visit sonomaartslive.
 org
LOCATION:Sonoma Arts Live
URL:http://www.sonomaartslive.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
