BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Under the Same Moon at Songbird Parlour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261223T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261223T210000
UID:261009hsx0a2FOSkaq8e5wl_YspA
DESCRIPTION:Under the Same Moon: A Jack London Birthday Dinner at Songbird
  Parlour honors the legendary author and his deep connection to Glen Ellen
 \, the place he called home and helped inspire the name "Valley of the Moo
 n." Held beneath a rare super full moon\, this intimate evening celebrates
  London's life\, writing\, and enduring connection to Sonoma Valley. The d
 inner features a thoughtfully crafted menu inspired by excerpts from his o
 wn words\, paired with wines sourced from Glen Ellen and the surrounding a
 rea. Rooted in local history\, literature\, and the spirit of the valley\,
  the experience offers a unique tribute to the writer who left such a last
 ing mark on Sonoma. Guests can expect an evening that is intimate\, litera
 ry\, and deeply connected to place. Menu coming soon. Reservations open so
 on.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/under-the-same-moon-a-jack-london-birthda
 y-dinner-at-songbird-parlour/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
