UID:261102sab98CUjlU2QjIQJkvFPyQ
DESCRIPTION:Bring Joy was founded by guitarist Jason Beard as a mission st
 atement project to make the world a better place through music.  The band 
 brings a high energy foot stomping good time to its live shows blending th
 eir original music in the genres of Jam\, Bluegrass\, Americana and Rock. 
   In addition to their original sets the band has also reinterpreted sets 
 of Pink Floyd\, Allman Brothers\, Billy Strings\, Paul Simon\, Phish\, and
  80’s Dance.  The band was formed from jam sessions with some of Norther
 n California’s best established musicians.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1040779991?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
