UID:2610313tH5EVczF06jOfkMamWT1g
DESCRIPTION:Steely Dead is a musical hybrid of Grateful Dead and Steely Da
 n. Sonic worlds collide between the structure\, arrangement and precision 
 studio recordings of rock legends Steely Dan\, cross-pollinated with the G
 rateful Dead’s free flowing\, melodic improvisation and masterful song s
 egues. Steely Dead merges these major concepts together while infusing the
  influence unto each band. For example taking the Grateful Dead’s rockin
 g set-ender Deal and Steely Dan’s Reelin’ in the Years creating the ma
 shup Dealin’ in the Years. Steely Dead is committed to the nuance of bot
 h bands while remaining playful with jam segues between songs\, and delive
 ring a unique musical blend. For fans of both or either one of these great
  bands.
LOCATION:Napa Music Hall
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109060731?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261230T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261230T170000
UID:260824ANwt9e4Wek-If3Bs2jDYDw
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\n*Maple Magic* *& Winter Wonder* invites
  visitors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativ
 ity\, and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided wal
 ks\, hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by t
 he changing landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the 
 sweet fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experienc
 e the peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
